sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant Ctrl as ReservationController (Calin)
    participant Sec as CurrentUser (Stefania)
    participant Res as ReservationService (Calin)
    participant Clk as Clock (Calin)
    participant Cat as CatalogApi (Liviu)
    participant Repo as ReservationRepository (Calin)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 18

    User->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/reservations (assetId, startTime, endTime)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Sec: currentUser.id()
    Sec-->>Ctrl: studentId
    Ctrl->>Res: createReservation(studentId, request)
    activate Res

    Note over Res: @Transactional method begins

    Res->>Clk: LocalDateTime.now(clock)
    Clk-->>Res: current Bucharest time

    Note over Res: Validate slot invariants:<br/>- 08:00 to 20:00 opening hours<br/>- :00 or :30 alignment<br/>- 30 min to 4 hour duration<br/>- within 14 days, future time

    Res->>Repo: countActiveByUserId(studentId)
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) WHERE user_id = :id AND status IN ('CONFIRMED', 'CHECKED_OUT', 'OVERDUE')
    DB-->>Repo: count
    Repo-->>Res: count
    deactivate Repo

    alt count >= 2
        Res-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict (ACTIVE_RESERVATIONS_LIMIT_EXCEEDED)
    end

    Note over Res: Pessimistic Row Locking to prevent double bookings
    Res->>Cat: lockForBooking(assetId)
    activate Cat
    Cat->>DB: SELECT * FROM assets WHERE id = :id FOR UPDATE
    Note over DB: Acquires exclusive RowExclusiveLock.<br/>Concurrent bookings on same asset wait here.
    DB-->>Cat: Asset
    Cat-->>Res: void
    deactivate Cat

    Res->>Repo: hasOverlappingReservations(assetId, start, end)
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE asset_id = :id<br/>AND status IN ('CONFIRMED', 'CHECKED_OUT', 'OVERDUE')<br/>AND start_time < :end AND end_time > :start
    DB-->>Repo: overlapping rows
    Repo-->>Res: boolean exists
    deactivate Repo

    alt Overlap exists
        Res-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict (RESERVATION_OVERLAP)
    end

    Res->>Repo: save(Reservation[status=CONFIRMED, assetId, studentId, start, end])
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations (...)
    DB-->>Repo: persisted row
    Repo-->>Res: Reservation
    deactivate Repo

    Note over Res,DB: Transaction commits, releasing PostgreSQL row lock

    Res-->>Ctrl: ReservationResponse
    deactivate Res
    Ctrl-->>User: 201 Created (ReservationResponse JSON)
    deactivate Ctrl
